 ],
 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "This man is being fined, and he hasn't broken a single law.",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 3.4
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "Well, he has. In medieval England, the law said every free man must own a weapon.",
   "s": 3.64,
   "e": 8.38
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "And not just own one. Be trained on it, and keep it ready.",
   "s": 8.6,
   "e": 11.64
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "The rule was called the Assize of Arms, and it worked like a tax bracket of violence.",
   "s": 11.86,
   "e": 16.52
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "The poorest man owed a gambeson and a spear. The richest? Chain mail and a warhorse.",
   "s": 16.92,
   "e": 22.14
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "Officials rode through towns checking, and if you came up short, you paid.",
   "s": 22.46,
   "e": 26.16
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "Why? Because the king had no army he could call on demand.",
   "s": 26.42,
   "e": 29.44
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "The citizens were the army. Every blacksmith was a waiting soldier.",
   "s": 29.44,
   "e": 33.58
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "If invaders landed on the coast, the alarm went out village by village.",
   "s": 33.84,
   "e": 37.94
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "text": "Men grabbed whatever they owned and ran to fight for free.",
   "s": 38.32,
   "e": 41.04
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "text": "It saved the crown a fortune. A standing army costs a fortune; a legally armed public costs nothing.",
   "s": 41.26,
   "e": 47.62
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "text": "The catch? An armed public is also a dangerous public, and kings spent centuries worrying about both.",
   "s": 47.88,
   "e": 54.14
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "text": "And here's the wild part. The weapon laws never really died.",
   "s": 54.44,
   "e": 57.8
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "text": "England's last archery requirement stayed on the books until the 1960s.",
   "s": 58.08,
   "e": 63.22
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "text": "For seven hundred years, the government's backup plan was basically \"bring your own army.\"",
   "s": 63.32,
   "e": 68.34
  }
 ]
}